; logic_data_01 119E44-119F4A  NHL 96 PC HOCKEY.EXE dseg04
; Tables of referee signal animations, penalty shot paths, fight animations and line change choices.
; generated by tools/build/gen_src.py, assembled by ./build.sh (see docs/ASM_BUILD.md)
